ConioInputEventToAnsi(InputBuffer->Header.Console, &InputRecord[i]);
```
Reason:
The fix changes the loop to iterate over the input records using an incrementing index `i`, ensuring that each record is accessed correctly without going out of bounds. This prevents memory corruption by properly referencing the input records in the buffer.

